<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes" />
    <title><%= pageTitle %> — Influzer.ai</title>
    <meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonicalUrl %>" />
    <%- include('partials/seo-social', {
      ogTitle: pageTitle + ' — Influzer.ai',
      ogDescription: metaDescription,
      ogUrl: canonicalUrl,
    }) %>
    <%- include('partials/favicon-links') %>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mcp-setup-page.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mcp-scoreboard.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mcp-sponsor.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>" />
  </head>
  <body class="registry-page">
    <%- include('partials/home-header') %>

    <main class="setup-shell" id="main">
      <a class="setup-back" href="/mcp/promote">← Promote an MCP server</a>
      <p class="setup-eyebrow">Advertising rules · version <%= terms.version %></p>
      <h1 class="setup-title"><%= terms.title %></h1>
      <p class="setup-lead">
        These terms apply when you buy a labeled Sponsored placement on Influzer
        ($249/month). They sit on top of the general
        <a href="/terms">Terms and Conditions</a>.
        Effective <%= terms.effective_date %>.
      </p>

      <section class="promote-terms-block">
        <h2>1. What you are buying</h2>
        <p>
          A labeled advertising placement — not a ranking, not a SAFE badge, and not a handshake result.
          Influzer may refuse any creative or listing that is unclear, misleading, or off-topic for an MCP developer directory.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="promote-terms-block">
        <h2>2. What is allowed</h2>
        <ul>
          <% terms.allowed.forEach(function(item) { %>
            <li><%= item %></li>
          <% }); %>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="promote-terms-block promote-terms-block--ban">
        <h2>3. What is not allowed</h2>
        <p>Do not promote any of the following. This list is not exhaustive — Influzer decides edge cases.</p>
        <ul class="promote-ban-list">
          <% terms.prohibited.forEach(function(item) { %>
            <li>
              <b><%= item.label %></b>
              <span><%= item.detail %></span>
            </li>
          <% }); %>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="promote-terms-block">
        <h2>4. Removal, cancellation, and fees</h2>
        <ul>
          <% terms.removal_rights.forEach(function(item) { %>
            <li><%= item %></li>
          <% }); %>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Practically: if the ad is porn, gambling, a scam, malware, hate, illegal, or otherwise banned,
          we can take it down immediately, cancel the subscription, and <b>keep money already paid</b> for that period.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="promote-terms-block">
        <h2>5. Your warranties</h2>
        <p>
          You confirm you have the right to advertise the listing, that the MCP URL and copy are accurate,
          and that the placement will not violate these terms for the whole subscription period.
          If the listing changes into a prohibited category after purchase, tell us or we may still remove it under §4.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="promote-terms-block">
        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions or appeals:
          <a href="mailto:<%= terms.contact %>?subject=Sponsored%20placement%20terms"><%= terms.contact %></a>.
          Buying a slot requires accepting this page at checkout.
        </p>
        <p><a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--primary" href="/mcp/promote">Back to promote →</a></p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/registry-footer') %>
    <script src="/js/registry.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>
